<title>USA: Puget Sound Energy to reedem pfd stock.</title>
<headline>Puget Sound Energy to reedem pfd stock.</headline>
<dateline>BELLVUE, Wash. 1997-06-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Puget Sound Energy said Friday it had called for redemption on July 15 its outstanding 7-7/8 percent preferred stock, at $25 a share plus accrued dividends of $0.329024.</p>
</text>
